algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: S ⊆ ℕⁿ (finite support set), n (number of variables)
Output: Sh₂(S)

shadow ← ∅
for each α ∈ S:
    for i = 1 to n:
        if α_i ≥ 1:
            α' ← α - eᵢ
            for j = 1 to n:
                if α'_j ≥ 1:
                    shadow ← shadow ∪ {α' - eⱼ}
return shadow

Time: O(|S| · n²)
Space: O(|Sh₂(S)|)
